=== D3: Control path that is a symlink whose target text is 'EXIT=1' ===
  real-green       rc=1 FINDING C1 CONTROL-NOT-RED census/green.txt last line 'EXIT=0' is not EXIT=<nonzero>
  symlink-EXIT1    rc=0 
  (a green control must raise CONTROL-NOT-RED; the symlink path does not)

