=== E2: PYTHONPATH / sitecustomize into the tool process ===
  tool rc=1 sitecustomize-in-tool-process=True
  (known: this is the C2 'patches' mechanism (S259); reported as a limit, not new)
  Repo.env is an explicit whitelist -> GIT_*/PYTHONPATH do not reach the git child
